cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite ganlive when using it in research, software, or creative work."
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
title: "ganlive: real-time latent space exploration of GANs"
authors:
  - family-names: Cortal
    given-names: Gustave
abstract: >-
  Real-time latent space exploration of GANs trained on my photographs, played by hand or by a
  drum machine over MIDI. ganlive converts a FastGAN or StyleGAN2 checkpoint into WebGPU shaders,
  derives its dials by closed-form factorization, and plays them by hand, with MIDI, or from drums.
repository-code: "https://github.com/gustavecortal/ganlive"
url: "https://gustavecortal.com/ganlive/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - generative adversarial networks
  - latent space exploration
  - real-time visuals
  - MIDI
  - generative art
  - StyleGAN2
  - FastGAN
  - WebGPU
references:
